{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">香港「七公主」中的「二公主」沈芝華，日前迎來了 80 歲大壽，喜獲馮素波、陳寶珠、姜大衞、李琳琳等一眾好友一同前來為她慶祝。好友馮素波事後亦在社交網大晒溫馨合照，並留言送上祝福：「我們一起恭祝沈芝華，生日快樂！身體健康！」</p><h4 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></h4><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">從相片中所見，「二公主」沈芝華保養得非常之好，她留着一頭短髮，面帶微笑，整個人看起來精神奕奕，完全看不出已經是 80 歲的高齡，風采依然。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"a6b1b2ac-f0c4-4369-8a5f-3f2b9dd710b7.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/20265UYy5LDjuA1784604538.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a6b1b2ac-f0c4-4369-8a5f-3f2b9dd710b7.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"56c837a8-9a94-42d5-9bad-dc83a44d5f3a.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026QHXBfb0cXH1784604543.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"56c837a8-9a94-42d5-9bad-dc83a44d5f3a.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h4 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></h4><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">回顧演藝歷程，沈芝華與馮素波、陳寶珠、蕭芳芳、薛家燕、王愛明及馮寶寶等於 1965 年結義金蘭，並在隨後的 1967 年合拍了經典電影《七公主》。在拍完 1967 年的電影《頂天立地》後，沈芝華選擇淡出影壇，回歸平凡生活。在感情生活方面，她當年曾與金川結婚並育有一子，惟婚姻最終遺憾以離婚收場；其後她選擇再婚，並移居美國生活，如今生活美滿愜意。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-22T01:09:49.955985+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":354,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}